{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7600428","formula":"C₅₁H₇₈O₈","hill":"C51H78O8","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":51.0,"H":78.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Staphyloxanthin","uk":"Стафілоксантин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Staphyloxanthin is a carotenoid pigment that is produced by some strains of Staphylococcus aureus, and is responsible for the characteristic golden color that gives S. aureus its species name. Staphyloxanthin also acts as a virulence factor. It has an antioxidant action that helps the microbe evade death by reactive oxygen species produced by the host immune system.","uk":"Стафілоксантин — каротиноїдний пігмент, який виробляється більшістю штамів золотистого стафілокока, і відповідає за характерний золотистий колір колоній на чашках Петрі. Саме завдяки стафілоксантину золотистий стафілокок (S. aureus) отримав свою назву. Стафілоксантин діє як фактор вірулентності."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":56928085,"mass":819.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCC(C)CCCCCCCCCCC(=O)OC[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@@H](O1)OC(=O)/C(=C/C=C/C(=C/C=C/C(=C/C=C/C=C(\\C)/C=C/C=C(\\C)/CCC=C(C)C)/C)/C)/C)O)O)O","inchikey":"PDOUICUKTQRPHO-MENSNCDRSA-N","iupac":"[(2S,3R,4S,5S,6R)-3,4,5-trihydroxy-6-(12-methyltetradecanoyloxymethyl)oxan-2-yl] (2E,4E,6E,8E,10E,12E,14E,16E,18E)-2,6,10,15,19,23-hexamethyltetracosa-2,4,6,8,10,12,14,16,18,22-decaenoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"56928085","atoms":137,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":15.601,"y":-3.237,"z":-2.383,"el":"C"},{"x":15.81,"y":-2.023,"z":-1.486,"el":"C"},{"x":15.799,"y":-2.355,"z":0.019,"el":"C"},{"x":16.924,"y":-3.333,"z":0.387,"el":"C"},{"x":15.944,"y":-1.085,"z":0.882,"el":"C"},{"x":14.846,"y":-0.022,"z":0.747,"el":"C"},{"x":13.452,"y":-0.47,"z":1.206,"el":"C"},{"x":12.558,"y":-0.953,"z":0.05